<div class="owner-landing"><section class="landing-hero"><div><span class="owner-eyebrow">CARE FOR THE ONES YOU LOVE</span><h1>A happier life.<br /><em>A healthier pet.</em></h1><p>Keep every little detail of their care together. Find pre-loved essentials, share moments, and connect with fellow pet owners.</p><div class="landing-actions"><a class="owner-button" href="/my-pets">Meet your pet's care hub →</a><a href="/marketplace">Explore the marketplace</a></div><div class="landing-proof"><span>One shared account</span><span>Web + Mobile</span><span>Made for pet owners</span></div></div><div class="landing-photo"><img src="/hero.png" alt="A happy pet ready for a day of care" /><span>Little moments.<br /><strong>Lifelong companions.</strong></span></div></section><section class="landing-section"><span class="owner-eyebrow">EVERYDAY CARE, ALL TOGETHER</span><h2>Everything they need.<br />Everything you care about.</h2><div class="landing-features"><a href="/my-pets"><span class="feature-icon">♡</span><small>01 · CARE</small><h3>Your pet's story</h3><p>Health records, feeding routines, medication progress, and a shareable Digital Pet ID.</p><strong>Open My Pets →</strong></a><a href="/marketplace"><span class="feature-icon">♧</span><small>02 · SHOP</small><h3>Good finds. Second lives.</h3><p>Buy and sell pre-loved pet essentials. Every Pet Owner can create a listing.</p><strong>Find something special →</strong></a><a href="/community"><span class="feature-icon">☀</span><small>03 · CONNECT</small><h3>A community that cares</h3><p>Celebrate the small wins. Share photos, reply to stories, and message pet owners.</p><strong>Join the conversation →</strong></a></div></section><section class="landing-id"><div><span class="owner-eyebrow">A LITTLE CARD. A BIG CONNECTION.</span><h2>Their identity,<br />always within reach.</h2><p>A QR code connects your pet's ID to a public card. You decide whether to share your phone number.</p><a class="owner-button" href="/my-pets">Create their Pet ID →</a></div><div class="id-art"><span>SHOPPET CARE</span><strong>Made for<br />your best friend.</strong><small>Identity · Care · Connection</small></div></section><section class="landing-section landing-bottom"><h2>Make room for more happy moments.</h2><p>Start with one pet and five health records for free. Unlock unlimited pets and care records with ₱49 lifetime Premium.</p><a class="owner-button" href="/premium">Explore Premium →</a><small class="demo-copy">Academic project · Payments are simulated. No real payment details are collected.</small></section></div>
